                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The U.S. Department of Agriculture wants to collect and share the sensitive personal data of recipients of the Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program (SNAP).\n \nMarylanders rely on SNAP to feed their families, not put their privacy at risk.\n \nI joined a coalition of attorneys general to oppose this proposal and protect the rights of families who depend on programs to keep them safe, nourished, and healthy.\n \nFull press release: https://t.co/ODKJpUHR4h",
