                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today my Office secured a preliminary injunction that blocks the Trump administration's demand for private information on millions of Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program (SNAP) recipients.\u00a0Maryland was part of a coalition that fought back against this unprecedented data grab that threatened both residents' privacy and their access to critical food assistance.\u00a0\n\nWe'll continue defending Marylanders' rights and their ability to put food on the table.\n\nRead more:\u00a0\nhttps://t.co/37sD6uptJN",
