                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I filed a lawsuit today to stop the U.S. Department of Agriculture, the federal agency that oversees the Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program (SNAP), from wrongly cutting off food benefits for lawful permanent residents. \n\nThis policy misreads federal law and would take food away from Maryland families who are fully eligible for help. We are asking the court to block it so people do not lose the support they need.\n\nFull press release: https://t.co/QWuzuxIiM0",
